class="text-[24px] md:text-[36px] xl:text-[44px] text-center leading-[126%] mb-[30px]">Try Socrates<span class="inline-flex w-[36px] h-[36px] md:w-[56px] md:h-[56px] xl:w-[70px] xl:h-[70px] rotate-[-5deg] translate-y-[6px] xl:translate-y-[15px] mx-[8px] [filter:drop-shadow(0_8px_12px_rgba(207,200,187,0.71))]"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="73" height="73" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[100%]" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/appIcon.101f51c6.svg"/></span>with an<!-- --> <a href="https://go.socrates.im/view/vxa6Li7cPNgVgP43ghfi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#FB9937] hover:text-[#FDAC1C] active:text-[#E88019] font-medium">interactive demo.</a> </h3></div></div></div></section><section class="py-[60px] md:pt-[100px] md:pb-[140px] bg-[#EAE7E1] rounded-[30px]"><div class=" "><div class="px-4"><div class="max-w-[710px] mx-auto text-center mb-[40px] md:mb-[50px] xl:mb-[60px]"><div class="w-[44px] h-[44px] md:w-[66px] md:h-[66px] flex mx-auto mb-[20px] md:mb-[30px] rounded-[16px]" style="box-shadow:0px 9px 20px 0px rgba(134, 126, 126, 0.40)"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="68" height="68" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-[100%]" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/increase.46c10f11.svg"/></div><h2 class="text-[28px] font-regular md:text-[52px] leading-[110%] mb-[30px] md:mb-[40px] xl:mb-[60px] text-[#242424] text-center xl:text-[60px] tracking-[-0.03em]">How Socrates Empowers <br/> Your Document Analysis</h2></div><div class="max-w-[1336px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between"><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(33.3%-15px)] md:max-w[405px] flex items-start md:flex-col xl:flex-row mb-[30px] md:mb-0"><div class="w-[32px] h-[32px] flex mr-[24px] md:mr-[0] md:mb-[24px] xl:mr-[24px] xl:mb-[0]"><img class="w-[100%]" src="/images/analysis/1.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="w-[calc(100%-56px)] text-[#242424] md:w-[100%] xl:w-[calc(100%-56px)]"><h6 class="text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] font-semibold  mb-[12px] tracking-[-0.03em]">Upload Your Document</h6><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em]">Support for PDFs, DOCX, EPUB, text files, and more.</p></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(33.3%-15px)] md:max-w[405px] flex items-start md:flex-col xl:flex-row mb-[30px] md:mb-0"><div class="w-[32px] h-[32px] flex mr-[24px] md:mr-[0] md:mb-[24px] xl:mr-[24px] xl:mb-[0]"><img class="w-[100%]" src="/images/analysis/2.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="w-[calc(100%-56px)] text-[#242424] md:w-[100%] xl:w-[calc(100%-56px)]"><h6 class="text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] font-semibold  mb-[12px] tracking-[-0.03em]">Get Answers</h6><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em]">Ask questions and instantly get complete answers using state-of-the-art AI.</p></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(33.3%-15px)] md:max-w[405px] flex items-start md:flex-col xl:flex-row mb-[30px] md:mb-0"><div class="w-[32px] h-[32px] flex mr-[24px] md:mr-[0] md:mb-[24px] xl:mr-[24px] xl:mb-[0]"><img class="w-[100%]" src="/images/analysis/3.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="w-[calc(100%-56px)] text-[#242424] md:w-[100%] xl:w-[calc(100%-56px)]"><h6 class="text-[18px] xl:text-[20px] font-semibold  mb-[12px] tracking-[-0.03em]">Sources Included</h6><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em]">Every response includes citations from the documents.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="features" class="pt-[60px] pb-[40px] md:pt-[100px] md:pb-[80px] xl:pt-[170px] bg-[#F4F2EE]"><div class=" "><div class="px-4"><div class="max-w-[710px] mx-auto text-center mb-[30px] md:mb-[60px]"><h2 class="text-[28px] font-regular md:text-[52px] leading-[110%] text-[#242424] text-center xl:text-[60px] tracking-[-0.03em]">Socrates Main Features</h2></div><div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto flex flex-col flex-wrap md:flex-row justify-between gap-y-[1px]"><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(50%-1px)] rounded-[30px] md:rounded-[40px] bg-[#ffffff] pt-[32px] pr-[20px] pb-[54px] pl-[32px] xl:p-[52px] flex flex-col items-start my-[1px] md:my-[0]"><div class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#FEF5EC] py-[12px] px-[20px] rounded-[47px] mb-[16px] md:mb-[24px] text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#242424] uppercase"><img class="w-[20px] h-[20px] mr-[8px]" src="/images/features/deepDive.svg" alt=""/>Deep Dive</div><div class="mb-[30px] pr-[10px] xl:mb-[50px]"><h5 class="text-[22px] md:text-[28px] xl:text-[40px] leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.03em] mb-[12px] md:mb-[20px] text-[#242424]">Go deeper than ever into long documents</h5><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#7E7C78]">Our AI intelligently breaks down documents and creates multiple search indexes for more accurate, thorough analysis.</p></div><div class="flex w-[100%] mt-auto"><div class=""></div></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(50%-1px)] rounded-[30px] md:rounded-[40px] bg-[#ffffff] pt-[32px] pr-[20px] pb-[54px] pl-[32px] xl:p-[52px] flex flex-col items-start my-[1px] md:my-[0]"><div class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#FEF5EC] py-[12px] px-[20px] rounded-[47px] mb-[16px] md:mb-[24px] text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#242424] uppercase"><img class="w-[20px] h-[20px] mr-[8px]" src="/images/features/promptLoops.svg" alt=""/>Flow AI</div><div class="mb-[30px] pr-[10px] xl:mb-[50px]"><h5 class="text-[22px] md:text-[28px] xl:text-[40px] leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.03em] mb-[12px] md:mb-[20px] text-[#242424]">Build your own AI workflows to extract exactly what you need</h5><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#7E7C78]">Pick and choose from multiple sources, apply multiple prompts, and get the answers to any question.</p></div><div class="flex w-[100%] mt-auto"><div class=""></div></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(50%-1px)] rounded-[30px] md:rounded-[40px] bg-[#ffffff] pt-[32px] pr-[20px] pb-[54px] pl-[32px] xl:p-[52px] flex flex-col items-start my-[1px] md:my-[0]"><div class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#FEF5EC] py-[12px] px-[20px] rounded-[47px] mb-[16px] md:mb-[24px] text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#242424] uppercase"><img class="w-[20px] h-[20px] mr-[8px]" src="/images/features/tableAi.svg" alt=""/>Table AI</div><div class="mb-[30px] pr-[10px] xl:mb-[50px]"><h5 class="text-[22px] md:text-[28px] xl:text-[40px] leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.03em] mb-[12px] md:mb-[20px] text-[#242424]">Compare and contrast multiple documents in a table</h5><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#7E7C78]">Visualize complex analysis with ease—AI works on every document and returns results in a structured table.</p></div><div class="flex w-[100%] mt-auto"><div class=""></div></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(50%-1px)] rounded-[30px] md:rounded-[40px] bg-[#ffffff] pt-[32px] pr-[20px] pb-[54px] pl-[32px] xl:p-[52px] flex flex-col items-start my-[1px] md:my-[0]"><div class="inline-flex items-center bg-[#FEF5EC] py-[12px] px-[20px] rounded-[47px] mb-[16px] md:mb-[24px] text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#242424] uppercase"><img class="w-[20px] h-[20px] mr-[8px]" src="/images/features/support.svg" alt=""/>Local LLM Support</div><div class="mb-[30px] pr-[10px] xl:mb-[50px]"><h5 class="text-[22px] md:text-[28px] xl:text-[40px] leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.03em] mb-[12px] md:mb-[20px] text-[#242424]">Run document analysis without sending data to the cloud</h5><p class="text-[16px] xl:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#7E7C78]">Perfect for users focused on data privacy and security.</p></div><div class="flex w-[100%] mt-auto"><div class=""></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=" pt-[60px] pb-[90px] xl:pb-[200px] bg-[#F4F2EE]"><div class=" "><div class="px-4"><div class="max-w-[710px] mx-auto text-center mb-[30px] md:mb-[50px] xl:mb-[60px]"><h3 class="text-[24px] font-regular md:text-[36px] leading-[126%] text-[#242424] text-center xl:text-[60px] tracking-[-0.03em]">Other helpful options</h3></div><div class="max-w-[1336px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between"><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(33.3%-15px)] md:max-w[405px] flex items-start md:flex-col xl:flex-row mb-[30px] md:mb-0"><div class="w-[32px] h-[32px] flex mr-[24px] md:mr-[0] md:mb-[24px] xl:mr-[24px] xl:mb-[0]"><img class="w-[100%]" src="/images/options/1.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="w-[calc(100%-56px)] text-[#242424] md:w-[100%] xl:w-[calc(100%-56px)]"><h6 class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] leading-[110%] font-semibold  mb-[12px]">Ask Questions of Multiple Documents at the Same Time</h6><p class="text-[16px] md:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[110%]">Select any set of documents to ask questions.</p></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(33.3%-15px)] md:max-w[405px] flex items-start md:flex-col xl:flex-row mb-[30px] md:mb-0"><div class="w-[32px] h-[32px] flex mr-[24px] md:mr-[0] md:mb-[24px] xl:mr-[24px] xl:mb-[0]"><img class="w-[100%]" src="/images/options/2.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="w-[calc(100%-56px)] text-[#242424] md:w-[100%] xl:w-[calc(100%-56px)]"><h6 class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] leading-[110%] font-semibold  mb-[12px]">Search Specific Pages within Documents</h6><p class="text-[16px] md:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[110%]">Some documents are LONG. Tell the AI to look in specific sections to get more focused answers.</p></div></div><div class="w-[100%] md:w-[calc(33.3%-15px)] md:max-w[405px] flex items-start md:flex-col xl:flex-row mb-[30px] md:mb-0"><div class="w-[32px] h-[32px] flex mr-[24px] md:mr-[0] md:mb-[24px] xl:mr-[24px] xl:mb-[0]"><img class="w-[100%]" src="/images/options/3.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="w-[calc(100%-56px)] text-[#242424] md:w-[100%] xl:w-[calc(100%-56px)]"><h6 class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] leading-[110%] font-semibold  mb-[12px]">Save Frequently Used Prompts</h6><p class="text-[16px] md:text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[110%]">Reuse simple or complex prompts with any chat.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="pricing" class="py-[140px] md:pt-[100px] md:pb-[80px] rounded-[30